{"id":"en-110","title":"Laser File Processing Steps | OneLaser X Series Guide","family":"x-series","topic":"guides","read_minutes":1,"source_url":"https://wiki.1laser.com/en/x-series/laser-cutting-file-processing-guide","source_updated_at":"2025-12-17T02:31:19.528Z","body_html":"<div><h2 id=\"laser-file-processing-steps\"> Laser File Processing Steps</h2>\n<p>Follow this step-by-step guide to prepare, send, focus, and process laser cutting and engraving files on <a href=\"/#/article/en-21\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OneLaser X Series machines</a>.</p><div>\n\n</div><h2 id=\"preparation-before-formally-processing-a-file\"> Preparation before formally processing a file</h2>\n<p>Before you start processing, please make sure that the equipment is in working order (i.e., external equipment installation and software connection have been completed). If necessary, please read the following article first.</p><div>\n\n</div><p><a href=\"/#/article/en-23\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Unboxing the X Series</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/#/article/en-106\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Connect XT &amp; XRF To LightBurn Via USB Cable</a></p><div>\n\n</div><h2 id=\"processing-steps\"> Processing steps</h2><div>\n\n</div><p><strong>1/ Turn on the machine and connect the software</strong></p>\n<figure>\n  <img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/laser-cutting-file-processing-guide/1_turn_on_the_machine.jpg\" alt=\"Turn on OneLaser X Series and connect to LightBurn\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">\n</figure><div>\n\n</div><p><strong>2/ Open the software and import the files you want to process</strong></p>\n<figure>\n  <img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/laser-cutting-file-processing-guide/2_open_the_software.jpg\" alt=\"Import laser cutting files into LightBurn software\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">\n</figure><div>\n\n</div><p><strong>3/ Adjust the file size</strong></p>\n<figure>\n  <img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/laser-cutting-file-processing-guide/3_adjust_the_file_size.jpg\" alt=\"Adjust laser file size in LightBurn workspace\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">\n</figure><div>\n\n</div><p><strong>4/ Set processing parameters.</strong> Processing parameters can be set according to the material tool test results.</p>\n<figure>\n  <img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/laser-cutting-file-processing-guide/4_set_processing_parameters.jpg\" alt=\"Set laser cutting and engraving parameters in LightBurn\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">\n</figure><div>\n\n</div><p><strong>5/ Send files to the machine</strong></p>\n<figure>\n  <img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/laser-cutting-file-processing-guide/5_send_files_to_the_machine.jpg\" alt=\"Send laser files from LightBurn to OneLaser machine\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">\n</figure><div>\n\n</div><p><strong>6/ Place the material on the work platform</strong></p>\n<figure>\n  <img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/laser-cutting-file-processing-guide/6_place_the_material_on_the_work_platform.jpg\" alt=\"Place material on OneLaser honeycomb work bed\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">\n</figure><div>\n\n</div><p><strong>7/ Move the laser head over the material</strong></p>\n<figure>\n  <img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/laser-cutting-file-processing-guide/7_move_the_laser_head_over_the_material.jpg\" alt=\"Position laser head over material surface\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">\n</figure><div>\n\n</div><p><strong>8/ Focus completed</strong></p>\n<figure>\n  <img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/laser-cutting-file-processing-guide/8_focus_completed.jpg\" alt=\"Laser focus completed on OneLaser X Series\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">\n</figure><div>\n\n</div><p><strong>9/ Move the laser head to the desired starting point</strong></p>\n<figure>\n  <img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/laser-cutting-file-processing-guide/9_move_the_laser_head_to_the_desired_starting_point.jpg\" alt=\"Move laser head to starting point on material\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">\n</figure>\n<figure>\n  <img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/laser-cutting-file-processing-guide/9_move_the_laser_head_to_the_desired_starting_point_2.jpg\" alt=\"Fine positioning laser head before cutting\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">\n</figure><div>\n\n</div><p><strong>10/ Click to locate and frame</strong></p>\n<figure>\n  <img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/laser-cutting-file-processing-guide/10_click_to_locate_and_frame.jpg\" alt=\"Frame laser job area using control panel\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">\n</figure><div>\n\n</div><p><strong>11/ Click to start processing</strong></p>\n<figure>\n  <img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/laser-cutting-file-processing-guide/11_click_to_start_processing.jpg\" alt=\"Start laser cutting or engraving job\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">\n</figure><div>\n\n</div><p><strong>12/ Processing completed</strong></p>\n<figure>\n  <img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/laser-cutting-file-processing-guide/12_processing_completed.jpg\" alt=\"Laser processing completed successfully\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">\n</figure>\n</div>","headings":[{"level":1,"id":"laser-file-processing-steps","text":"Laser File Processing Steps"},{"level":2,"id":"preparation-before-formally-processing-a-file","text":"Preparation before formally processing a file"},{"level":2,"id":"processing-steps","text":"Processing steps"}],"technical_version":"unknown"}